  "description": "Compact after the first data page was emptied by deleting Pg ID 1..4. Pg: 12 rows, ID and eight Text(255) fields T1..T8, each holding 61 repetitions of U+20AC (122 UTF-16 bytes of value; the character lies outside Latin-1). Then DBEngine.CompactDatabase of the mutated file into a work file (the mutated file is unchanged); the public state is read before the mutation, after it and from the compacted file.  Images: 'before' (the fixture copy as given), then one kept image of the closed file after each step; every step opens the database read/write, makes one mutation and closes it, with the DBEngine still alive. The compacted file is kept as a separate derivative (after-compact).",
